        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "A korma should be fragrant, not bland. Blooming the whole spices in ghee at the start, and blending the almond-coconut base until very smooth, makes the difference between a flat sauce and a rich one." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
